Niki Agent
==========

Niki Agent is an independent terminal coding agent. The agent loop, the tools,
the approval policy, the provider adapters, the MCP client and the terminal UI
are written in this repository and compiled into one executable.

The binary links third-party Rust crates. Each keeps its own licence, and the
exact versions are recorded in `Cargo.lock`. The MIT license at the repository
root applies to Niki Agent.
